{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aOl0kdv9391795043169.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有聯儲局官員表態，認為下月加息幅度可達半厘，金價跌至十四個月低位。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報3,741.9美元一盎司，跌122.3美元，跌幅百分之3.1。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價曾跌至3,720美元以下水平，跌幅超過百分之3.3，見去年9月以來低位。</p><p></p><p>Zaye Capital Markets首席投資總監阿斯拉姆認為，這波拋售反映美元走強，美國債息上升，以及市場預期中央銀行將進一步收緊貨幣政策。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.341551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.257991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:36.056627+00:00","content_hash":"64763805090fa561f0dc35abe477cfee5e168effe9e72281ca197f7ca5039a3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.341551+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}